{
  "name": "lifeos",
  "description": "LifeOS is a personal behavioral feedback system that translates monthly goals into controllable daily processes, scores daily execution, and adapts every week through reflection. It is a serverless Angular 19 single-page app that runs a real SQLite engine in the browser via sql.js (WebAssembly), persisting the database to IndexedDB after every mutation with an optional on-disk data vault for a user-owned copy.",
